<http://taxref.mnhn.fr/lod/property/bioGeoStatusIn> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "(deprecated). Relates a taxon to a biogeograpical status within a certain region. As of TAXREF v12, this property should no longer be used. Instead use class taxrefstatus:BioGeographicalStatus"@en;
                                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                                    rdfs:isDefinedBy taxref-ld:taxref-ld;
                                                    rdfs:label "has biogeograpical status"@en;
