                    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "Franck Michel, Olivier Gargominy, Sandrine Tercerie, Catherine Faron Zucker. A Model to Represent Nomenclatural and Taxonomic Information as Linked Data. Application to the French Taxonomic Register, TAXREF. In Proceedings of the 2nd International Workshop on Semantics for Biodiversity (S4Biodiv) co-located with ISWC 2017, Oct 2017, Vienna, Austria. CEUR Vol. 1933, pp.1-12, 2017";
